{{#is_alert}}
IPsec tunnel {{tunnel.name}} (gateway {{gateway.name}}, peer {{peer_ip.name}}) on firewall {{device_ip.name}} has not been active for the last 15 minutes: it is inactive or stuck initializing. Traffic to the remote network is not flowing through it. Check the IKE gateway, the peer's reachability, and that both sides use matching proposals and keys. If this tunnel is down on purpose, or only comes up when traffic arrives (no tunnel monitor configured), exclude it by adding `!tunnel:{{tunnel.name}}` to the query.
{{/is_alert}}

{{#is_recovery}}
IPsec tunnel {{tunnel.name}} (gateway {{gateway.name}}, peer {{peer_ip.name}}) on firewall {{device_ip.name}} is active again.
{{/is_recovery}}
